# Marketing site (Vite)
#
# ── Development (`npm run dev`) ──
# Call the live API directly so a local /api proxy cannot 500 the pages.
VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://backend.novacarrentals.com
VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=https://backend.novacarrentals.com
#
# ── Production (`npm run build`) ──
# REQUIRED when hosting dist/public as static files (cPanel, Netlify, etc.).
# Without this, the browser calls https://YOUR-SITE.com/api/... which has no backend.
# Copy .env.production.example → .env.production and set your live API host, then rebuild:
#
#   cp .env.production.example .env.production
#   npm run build
#
# VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://backend.novacarrentals.com
# VITE_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://novacarrentals.com
